    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/b50c699d5add3b89e42ebc8b3f0b3806.avif?t=1735819865\" /></span><br><br>Made entirely by A 15-Year-Old Aspiring Game Developer,<br><br>Step into a futuristic, <strong>colourless </strong>world as a <i>robotic protagonist</i>. Unleash your mastery over machines and the power of <strong><u>COLOURS</u></strong> to unravel <strong>mind-bending puzzles</strong>. Are you ready to <u>bend reality</u>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/f2c4fbc068e2ff424552234872284b8d.poster.avif?t=1735819865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/f2c4fbc068e2ff424552234872284b8d.webm?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/f2c4fbc068e2ff424552234872284b8d.mp4?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/e3b72430ee16e895fed2dc09a1e407a0.poster.avif?t=1735819865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/e3b72430ee16e895fed2dc09a1e407a0.webm?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/e3b72430ee16e895fed2dc09a1e407a0.mp4?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Combine </strong>Colours to form new Colours!<br></li><li><strong>Split </strong>Colours into their Constituents!<br></li><li>Solve <i>mind-bending</i> puzzles in an expansive post-apocalyptic world<br></li><li>Meet many <strong>funny</strong> and <strong>charming</strong> robot characters!<br></li><li>Uncover the dark truth behind a <strong>dystopian </strong>world of dead robots<br></li><li>5 Chapters, <strong>5 Locations</strong>, 5 Characters, 1 Journey, are you ready?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/4234bc284a24584788c76833ace0f795.poster.avif?t=1735819865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/4234bc284a24584788c76833ace0f795.webm?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272310/extras/4234bc284a24584788c76833ace0f795.mp4?t=1735819865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
